<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acropora-millepora-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acropora millepora Holocene Turing wavenumber at 385.2 µm (pass 1) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 76/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the Lundgren et al. 2013 colony beside the activator field, and the 12-frame 720×540 GIF scores cv_sim_similarity 86.1. The field is a spot lattice, not a branch photograph, and pass 1 does not gauge-fix its orientation. The colony photo is the wrong physical scale for a 385 µm claim, which caps this score." ;
